n":["The ",["$","$L18","a-0",{"href":"/learn/ai-engineer-fde/async-systems/what-is-a-queue","children":"first lesson"}]," introduced a queue as a waiting place between a producer and a worker. The next question is what the website may promise when it places a job there. An asynchronous API acknowledges ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"acceptance"}],", not completion. In the document export example, a successful request means the operation was durably recorded and can be found again. It does not mean a file exists yet."]}],"\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d"],false]}]]}],"$L2e"]}]}]
