1d:["$","p","p-3",{"children":"The broker message should point to durable business state; it need not carry an entire document or sensitive payload."}]
1e:["$","pre","pre-0",{"children":["$","code","code-0",{"className":"language-json","children":"{\n  \"jobId\": \"job_82\",\n  \"operationId\": \"exp_82\",\n  \"tenantId\": \"tenant_7\",\n  \"type\": \"export.generate\",\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"traceId\": \"trace_19\"\n}\n"}]}]
1f:["$","p","p-4",{"children":[["$","code","code-0",{"children":"jobId"}]," identifies the delivery; ",["$","code","code-1",{"children":"operationId"}]," identifies the effect across deliveries. The worker checks that the tenant and operation still match, validates the schema version, and loads authorized source data from the system of record. Do not trust a message merely because it came from a queue: producers can be buggy or compromised, and old messages can outlive an authorization change."]}]
